    "created_at": "2020-06-09T07:46:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-09T07:46:26Z",
    "body": "Why this can't be done automatically by the browser?\r\n\r\nJust like any other performance proposal, this proposal needs to be backed up by data showing the performance improvements. Ideally, it should have to be demonstrated that it's faster on at least one benchmark that isn't a microbenchmark.",
